{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123888","id":4654641905,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFXAy8Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123888","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123888.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123888.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123888","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123888/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123888/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123888/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/48a810c59b112e1321423aa9dfac2e1cb46f0742","number":123888,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[.Net] Add `params` to the Span overloaded variadic methods parameter","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As we move to .NET 10 in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123738, we can finally finish the remaining work in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96329 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106765.\r\n\r\nAfter this PR, the `Array.AddRange`, `Callable.Call`, and other generated built-in ReadOnlySpan variations of the vararg engine APIs will have their variadic parameter annotated with `params`. This has several benefits that are already discussed in [what's new in .NET 9](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/whats-new/dotnet-9/libraries#params-readonlyspant-overloads), but TLDR, it's one less GC-tracked array in places where applicable.\r\n\r\ne.g.\r\n```csharp\r\nvar myCallable = new Callable(this. MethodName.MyMethodWithTwoArgs);\r\n\r\n\r\n// Binds to Callable.Call(params Variant[] args) before this PR, cause one GC tracked Variant[] array that needs to be collected later\r\n// Binds to Callable.Call(params ReadOnlySpan<Variant> args) after this PR, C# compiler will choose an applicable non-gc allocated way to pass these values, stackalloc, InlineArray, etc.\r\nmyCallable.Call(\"foo\", \"bar\");\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore and After examples:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n- public Error EmitSignal(StringName signal, ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n+ [System.Runtime.CompilerServices.OverloadResolutionPriority(1)]\r\n+ public Error EmitSignal(StringName signal, params ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n\r\n- public Error Rpc(StringName method, ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n+ [System.Runtime.CompilerServices.OverloadResolutionPriority(1)]\r\n+ public Error Rpc(StringName method, params ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n\r\n- public void CallGroupFlags(long flags, StringName group, StringName method, ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n+ [System.Runtime.CompilerServices.OverloadResolutionPriority(1)]\r\n+ public void CallGroupFlags(long flags, StringName group, StringName method, params ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n\r\n- public void AddDoMethod(GodotObject @object, StringName method, ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n+ [System.Runtime.CompilerServices.OverloadResolutionPriority(1)]\r\n+ public void AddDoMethod(GodotObject @object, StringName method, params ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)\r\n```\r\n\r\nCompatibility: there shouldn't be any issues; we are focusing on Godot APIs instead of user ones, and the ROS variations of the Godot APIs are guaranteed to be equivalent to the Array variation (in fact, the Array version, after the two PRs, calls the ROS version under the hood).\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: Zero AI is involved.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":16503691,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A-9OL","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/26","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/26","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/26/labels","number":26,"state":"open","title":"4.9","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repi